// Fixture inventory for the No Mercy (NW4E) topology recorded in
// `docs/plans/corpus-certification-frontier.md:1829`: 5 overlay generations,
// shard counts [3, 3, 5, 8, 5] per generation, 24 entries total.
//
// This is NOT a real, buildable No Mercy shard tree -- there are no sibling
// `lib.rs`/leaf `Cargo.toml` files here, and bringing No Mercy up is
// explicitly out of scope (see docs/plans/corpus-certification-frontier.md,
// "The remaining wall"). Its only job is to be a second, differently-shaped
// `shard_inventory.in` that `FN64_WM_SHARD_TITLE` can select at compile time,
// so `shard_selector_test.rs` can prove the `include!` path in
// `generated_runner_build/mod.rs` is a real selector and not a fixed literal
// wearing an env-var costume.
